OL,3,W"###"###"###T//////,,/-,/-,/-.-.,//////
OL,4,CFire in vehicle workshop forces        
OL,5,Cresidents from homes                   
OL,6,GResidents were forced to leave their   
OL,7,Ghomes after a fire broke out in a      
OL,8,Gvehicle workshop in the early hours.   
OL,10,FSix fire engines, a water carrier and  
OL,11,Fan aerial ladder platform were sent to 
OL,12,Fthe blaze on Burgess Road in           
OL,13,FSwaythling, Southampton, at about      
OL,14,F03:00 GMT.                             
OL,16,FFirefighters are working to tackle the 
OL,17,Ffire with some residents living close  
OL,18,Fto the workshop forced to leave their  
OL,19,Fhomes.                                 
OL,21,FThe A35 Burgess Road remains closed    
OL,22,Ffrom the A335 Thomas Lewis Way.   G1/4 
