OL,3,W"###"###"###T//////,,/-,/-,/-.-.,//////
OL,4,CUkrainian refugees are 'doing their    
OL,5,Cbest to cope'                          
OL,6,GMore than four-and-a-half years on     
OL,7,Gfrom the start of Ukraine-Russian war, 
OL,8,Ga leading figure in Reading's          
OL,9,GUkrainian community centre has         
OL,10,Greflected on how refugees have         
OL,11,Gassimilated.                           
OL,13,FMick Polleck said some arrivals have   
OL,14,Fmoved out of Reading and into          
OL,15,Fneighbouring counties as their lives   
OL,16,Fhave progressed since they moved to    
OL,17,Fthe UK.                                
OL,19,FIt is thought about 2,800 Ukrainians   
OL,20,Farrived in Berkshire after the         
OL,21,Finvasion in February 2022, but some    
OL,22,Fhave decided to return home.      G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
